","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1616,"retries":0},{"seq":254,"t":1800,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"My infantry at F1 is established. I should reinforce it and start securing other fords. I will move archers to support F1 and send a decoy to draw attention away from my main moves."},{"seq":255,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c99","house":"orchid","letter":"L124","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":1800,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":256,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c100","house":"orchid","letter":"L125","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2"],"depart":1800,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":257,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c101","house":"orchid","letter":"L126","kind":"decoy","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":1800,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT TIGER CAMP.","cipher":null},{"seq":258,"t":1800,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1622,"retries":0},{"seq":259,"t":1800,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Orchid has forces at F1 and s-mid. My doctrine is to take F1. I must move my infantry to F1. I will use cipher as per doctrine."},{"seq":260,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c102","house":"tiger","letter":"L127","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west"],"depart":2100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, HSNRB QK WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":261,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c103","house":"tiger","letter":"L128","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west"],"depart":2100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"OPRKJI EKKQ, HSNRB QK WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":262,"t":1800,"type":"delivered","courier":"c93","letter":"L118","house":"tiger"},{"seq":263,"t":1800,"type":"delivered","courier":"c101","letter":"L126","house":"orchid"},{"seq":264,"t":1802